{"id":"9efd20f439611336","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-atm.md","title":"df-atm (Alternating Turing Machine)","display":"df-atm (Alternating Turing Machine)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-configuration]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"display":"df-atm (Alternating Turing Machine)","label":"28-df-atm","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-atm","ATM","Alternating Turing Machine"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atm (Alternating Turing Machine)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-atm"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-atm</span><span>ATM</span><span>Alternating Turing Machine</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall\\subseteq Q\">\\(Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall\\subseteq Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\">\\(A=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_N\\)</span>、初始配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^0_{N,x}\">\\(C^0_{N,x}\\)</span> 和有限计算前缀集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_N(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}_N(x)\\)</span> 见本目录对应机器定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(t,s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_N,\\operatorname{space}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_N,\\operatorname{space}_N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nA=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\land N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land\nQ=Q_\\exists\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}Q_\\forall\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nA=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\land N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land\nQ=Q_\\exists\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}Q_\\forall\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{st}(\\langle q,T,i\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq q,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Succ}_A(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{Step}_N(C,C&#39;)\\},\\\\\nF_A(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{st}(C)=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{st}(C)\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_A(C)\\cap X\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{st}(C)\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_A(C)\\subseteq X\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid F_A(X)\\subseteq X\\},\\\\\nL(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid C^0_{N,x}\\in\\operatorname{Win}_A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{st}(\\langle q,T,i\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq q,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Succ}_A(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{Step}_N(C,C&#39;)\\},\\\\\nF_A(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{st}(C)=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{st}(C)\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_A(C)\\cap X\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid\\operatorname{st}(C)\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_A(C)\\subseteq X\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Conf}(N)\\mid F_A(X)\\subseteq X\\},\\\\\nL(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid C^0_{N,x}\\in\\operatorname{Win}_A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{blocks}_A(\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\n1+\\left|\\left\\{j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\operatorname{st}(C_{j-1})\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\operatorname{st}(C_j)\\in Q_\\forall)\\\\[-2pt]\n&amp;\\lor(\\operatorname{st}(C_{j-1})\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\operatorname{st}(C_j)\\in Q_\\exists)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\right|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{altblk}_A(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{blocks}_A(\\pi)\\mid\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_N(x)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{time}_A(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_N(x),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{space}_A(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{space}_N(x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{blocks}_A(\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\n1+\\left|\\left\\{j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\operatorname{st}(C_{j-1})\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\operatorname{st}(C_j)\\in Q_\\forall)\\\\[-2pt]\n&amp;\\lor(\\operatorname{st}(C_{j-1})\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\operatorname{st}(C_j)\\in Q_\\exists)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\right|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{altblk}_A(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{blocks}_A(\\pi)\\mid\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_N(x)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{time}_A(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_N(x),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{space}_A(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{space}_N(x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{ATIME}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{ASPACE}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{space}_A(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{time}_A(x)&lt;\\infty)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land q_0\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{altblk}_A(x)\\le k)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land q_0\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{altblk}_A(x)\\le k)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{ATIME}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{ASPACE}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{space}_A(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{time}_A(x)&lt;\\infty)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land q_0\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{altblk}_A(x)\\le k)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(A)\\mid A=(N,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathbf{ATM}\\land N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land q_0\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{altblk}_A(x)\\le k)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_A\">\\(F_A\\)</span> 单调，所有前不动点的交给出最小不动点，因此接受性不是仅凭名称指定的原语。非停机状态至少一个后继，避免空后继全称判断产生意外接受。有限时间界下，这与原书配置图上的接受标记过程和有限接受树等价。块数为切换次数加一，故一个块允许零次切换；资源由忽略状态标签后的同一机器所有分支计量。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义5.7–5.8；印刷99–100页；PDF125–126页。接受规则及交替次数已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t,s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\operatorname{time}_N,\\operatorname{space}_N$ 见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\